        "content": "### Private Supabase portal read model\nBearer token → hashed grant → exact `portal:read` customer or `portal:admin` sentinel → authenticated Supabase Edge Function → strict response validation.\n\nAirtable remains the source of truth, but this request path reads Supabase only. Customer grants stay client-scoped; admin grants are manual, short-lived, and global."
